        "created_at": "2017-04-12T03:15:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I got thinking the other day about how many of the heroes we've seen depicted in their homes. I came up with three:</p><ul>\n<li>Legacy, on the card \"Next Evolution\"</li>\n<li>Tachyon, in the <a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/comic?page=15\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Freedom Four Annual #1</a>\n</li>\n<li>Absolute Zero, sort of, <a href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=File:157784760.jpg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">during the ARG</a>\n</li>\n</ul><p>We also see Maia Montgomery in her \"normal\" life, if not at home, on the card \"Trust Fund.\"</p><p>Can anyone think of others?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:16.276Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
