        "raw": "<p>I got thinking the other day about how many of the heroes we&#39;ve seen depicted in their homes. I came up with three:</p><ul><li>Legacy, on the card &quot;Next Evolution&quot;</li><li>Tachyon, in the <a href=\"https://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/comic?page=15\">Freedom Four Annual #1</a></li><li>Absolute Zero, sort of, <a href=\"http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=File:157784760.jpg\">during the ARG</a></li></ul><p>We also see Maia Montgomery in her &quot;normal&quot; life, if not at home, on the card &quot;Trust Fund.&quot;</p><p>Can anyone think of others?</p>",
